  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security and Rural Development - Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing institutional and human capacity of local partners and participants to engage in advocacy: capacity building of partners; advocacy action for benefits for the target group; integration of cross-cutting issues; and advocacy work to influence policy development in favour of the intended outcomes of the project and poverty reduction. Special attention will be given people with special needs including people living with disabilities (PLWDs), female-headed households, youth-headed households and people living with HIV/AIDS (PLWHAS).</narrative>
  </description>
